> Open the repository on the Github
> Go to the settings
> Go to the manage access
> Under "Manage Access" => "Invite a collaborator"
> Add {username} to this repository

> Login to added username
> Then perform "Accept invitation"

> Go to the authentication {username} Github
> Go to the settings
> Go to the manage access
> Now "Direct Access" and "Manage Access" display added collaborator